I walk over to the fruit and vegetables.
There are many beautiful colors.
I take a red apple.
I like apples.
I put the apple in the cart.
I also take some bananas.
Then I take some tomatoes.
And I choose a green cucumber.
Then I see a strange vegetable.
I don't know it from Mexico.
I pick it up and turn it over.
What is this thing?
The sign says "parsnip".
"I'd like to try something new," I think.
I put the parsnip in my shopping cart.
